SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE — WHAT IS COVERED

This CC0 license applies to the following in this repository:

  ✓ The SVP specification text and schema definitions
  ✓ The AIT token payload schema (schema/ait-token.json)
  ✓ The SVP discovery document schema (schema/svp-discovery.json)
  ✓ The two-zone routing model definition (VAZ/GAZ)
  ✓ The audit record schema
  ✓ The IETF Internet-Draft text (draft-bravo-svp-ait-spec-00.txt)
  ✓ SDK reference implementations (python/, javascript/, rust/)
  ✓ Colab validation notebooks (notebooks/)
  ✓ All documentation files in this repository

